## Quickstart

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Requirements: a supported board — <img src="{{ root }}assets/emoji/mjolnir_thor_emoji.gif" alt="" width="20" align="absmiddle"> Jetson AGX Thor (JetPack 7.x), <img src="{{ root }}assets/emoji/mjolnir_orin_emoji.gif" alt="" width="20" align="absmiddle"> Jetson Orin (JetPack 7.2.1+) or <img src="{{ root }}assets/emoji/mjolni_spark_emoji.gif" alt="" width="20" align="absmiddle"> DGX Spark (DGX OS + CUDA 13), see [Supported Hardware](#supported-hardware) — with Docker + the NVIDIA Container Toolkit, and [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).

```bash
# the CLI (the package is mjolnir-cli; the command is `mjolnir`)
uv tool install mjolnir-cli

# one-time: Jetson host setup for stable numbers (clocks, power mode, fans, swap)
mjolnir hw setup

# serve: the active model's default config on the Mjolnir image, --attention-backend MJOLNIR, port 6001
mjolnir serve up
```

```bash
curl -s http://localhost:6001/v1/chat/completions \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{"model": "{{ ctx.model }}", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "hi"}], "max_tokens": 64}'
```

**Use the image directly** (any model, any vLLM flags):

```bash
docker run --rm -it --gpus all --ipc host -p 8000:8000 -e VLLM_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=HND \
  {{ ctx.image }} <model> --kv-cache-dtype fp8 --attention-backend MJOLNIR
```

